internal/dirnode/census_test.go:91://     a ninth constructor fails as unregistered.
internal/dirnode/census_test.go:92://  5. An axerror.New call outside every registered literal —
internal/dirnode/census_test.go:93://     REFUSED as a construction site outside the registered
internal/dirnode/census_test.go:94://     bodies.
