internal/dirnode/inventory_test.go:157:// TestFramedSubsetIsExact pins the deliverable boundary: the
internal/dirnode/inventory_test.go:158:// framed subset is exactly manifest, probe, and scan, and the
internal/dirnode/inventory_test.go:159:// unframed remainder is exactly the eight named registry members
internal/dirnode/inventory_test.go:160:// whose nested content owners are the sibling leaves. A fourth
internal/dirnode/inventory_test.go:161:// framed operation, or a ninth unframed one, reddens here.
internal/dirnode/inventory_test.go:162:func TestFramedSubsetIsExact(t *testing.T) {
internal/dirnode/inventory_test.go:163:	t.Parallel()
