internal/dirnode/bootstrap.go:7:// This file owns the Section 7.9 major bootstrap decision: the
internal/dirnode/bootstrap.go:8:// caller enumerates its locally supported majors in strictly
internal/dirnode/bootstrap.go:9:// descending order with one manifest request each, each attempt on a
internal/dirnode/bootstrap.go:10:// fresh process, and only the exact downgrade tuple authorizes the
