internal/dirnode/bootstrap.go:12://
internal/dirnode/bootstrap.go:13:// The decision is a pure function over the attempt outcome, so it is
internal/dirnode/bootstrap.go:14:// testable without spawning processes: DecideBootstrapStep takes the
