+Each name is prefixed `urn:ax:schema:` in the code and test table.
+
+## Mutation and importer evidence
+
+The package harness executes each narrowing alone under a source overlay,
+records the subprocess exit and raw JSON test log beside that overlay, and
+includes a harmless applied comment control that must survive. The final run
+killed all 29 narrowings, including the behavioral identity-validation bypass
+while retaining the `VerifyObjectIdentity` token; the one neutral comment
+control survived. `TASK-260830-nxqqaw_results.md` and the attached evidence
+archive name each mutant, test, exit code, and raw log. No source-text-only
+verdict substitutes for a behavioral test.
+
+Direct importer sets for the changed `canonicaljson`/`provhost` packages, the
+new inventory package, and its `rpcwire` dependency are listed with each
+imported entry, input class, and base/candidate outcome in
+[`IMPORTER-OUTCOMES.md`](IMPORTER-OUTCOMES.md). The conformance registry
+`internal/traceability/ownership.v0.7.0.json` is unchanged; the Story final
+leaf owns its update.
+
+## Measured acceptance ratio
+
+**2 of 4 producer-defined property rows are fully driven end to end**:
+deterministic trie construction and bounded serving. Membership has a complete
+mapping table but four mapped classes are not admitted; the exchange covers
+validated real objects but cannot reproduce the combined normative synthetic
+ID/byte fixture or downstream lease/durable rules. Partial rows are not
+counted as complete.
