+[`internal/merkleinventory`](internal/merkleinventory) is a separate in-memory
+Mesh RPC 2 component for deterministic namespace roots/children, schema
+membership, and bounded JSON object retrieval. It is not wired into the
+authenticated Host Channel handler, does not persist inventories or transfer
+chunks, and does not advertise an anti-entropy capability. RPC 3/4/5 inventory
+membership and their added authority rules remain unsupported by this
+component. Its validation boundaries and test commands are documented in the
+package README, [conformance matrix](internal/merkleinventory/CONFORMANCE-MATRIX.md),
+and [traceability](internal/merkleinventory/TRACEABILITY.md).
